  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moving Towards Sustainable Approaches to Prevent Violent Extremism in the Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project&apos;s interventions support the engagement of community liaison points in Western Balkan countries, capacitating young people in each community that will ensure access and facilitate activities, as well as provide critical support to direct monitoring activities within the field. In addition, the project supports monitoring, analysis, and the measurement of impact; community initiatives and dialogues; the design and implementation of tailored psychosocial support for at-risk of recruitment to violent extremism in targeted communities; and implementation in the field through community liaison points.</narrative>
  </description>
